        "row_fQcTNQ": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_6003_406ce15f-3010-433c-980a-0fd47371a8f8.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>About Neighbourhood<br/>A curated world beyond clothing.<br/><br/><br/>Founded in Arnhem in 2017, Neighbourhood is more than a menswear store.<br/><br/>It is a carefully curated world where clothing, art, craftsmanship and atmosphere come together. A place for men who appreciate quality, character and thoughtful design.<br/><br/>What started as an independent menswear store has evolved into a destination where clothing is approached with the same attention as art. A place built around craftsmanship, culture, creativity and the appreciation of things made to last.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_wk9WGn": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_5914.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Everything begins with attention. Attention to materials, silhouettes, colours, textures, provenance and the way garments are made. Every collection, object, image, piece of music and detail within our world is selected with intention.<br/><br/>Not driven by trends.<br/><br/>But by timeless style, craftsmanship and authenticity.<br/><br/>In a world of speed, overconsumption and endless online choices, we create a place where men can slow down. A place where quality takes precedence over quantity. Where history, materials and craftsmanship are valued as much as the finished product itself.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_mVzNFK": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_5893.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>We look at clothing the way a gallery looks at art: through composition, material, texture, light, history and emotion. That is why a visit to Neighbourhood feels different from a traditional menswear store.<br/><br/>More than a store, Neighbourhood is a destination. A place where stories are shared, inspiration is found and lasting wardrobes are built.<br/><br/><br/>Welcome to the world of Neighbourhood.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
