            "store_name": "",
            "address_line_1": "",
            "address_line_2": "",
            "body": "<p><strong>Meet the Founders</strong><br/><br/>Neighbourhood was founded by Pim Wiggers in 2017 with a simple belief: clothing should be approached with care, curiosity and respect for craftsmanship.<br/><br/>A year later, in 2018, Dianne walked into the store for the first time.<br/><br/>At that moment she was working for a large fashion company, but it quickly became clear that this was more than a visit. There was an immediate connection through a shared passion for clothing, creativity and storytelling.<br/><br/>What started as a conversation became a love story, and eventually a partnership in every sense of the word. Together, we built a family, a life and the world that Neighbourhood has become today.<br/><br/>Since then, we have been shaping Neighbourhood together. Not simply as a store, but as a place where clothing, art, atmosphere and culture come together.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
