        },
        "text_fwQEQg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Dianne brings a broad background in fashion, with years of experience in sales, visual merchandising, styling and product development. Her eye naturally gravitates towards details, composition and atmosphere. Growing up in a family of artists and poets, creativity has always been part of her world. She approaches Neighbourhood with the same sensitivity she has for art: through colour, balance, emotion and storytelling. Today, she is responsible for much of the visual identity, creative direction and the atmosphere that defines the Neighbourhood experience.<br/><br/>Pim's expertise lies in product knowledge, craftsmanship and timeless menswear. Having built years of experience at The Globe, the iconic Arnhem menswear store of family friend Harry Wonder, Pim developed an exceptional understanding of quality, craftsmanship and the stories behind the products. He is often described as a walking encyclopedia when it comes to clothing, fabrics and heritage brands. His ability to recognise emerging movements within menswear, while remaining grounded in timeless style, continues to shape the collections we curate today.<br/><br/>Together, we share a deep appreciation for craftsmanship, authenticity and products that are made with integrity. We believe clothing should not be disposable, but something that gains character over time and becomes part of a person's story.<br/><br/>But above all, Neighbourhood is built around family.<br/><br/>Together with our two daughters, Leda and Moné, creativity, curiosity and imagination are part of everyday life. Whether through art, photography, music, nature or the simple joy of discovering something new, they remind us daily to keep looking at the world with fresh eyes. Their energy and creativity continue to inspire the way we live, create and build Neighbourhood.<br/><br/>What began as a menswear store has grown into a carefully curated world where clothing, art, craftsmanship and atmosphere come together.<br/><br/>A reflection of our passions, our family and the things we believe are worth preserving.<br/><br/>Welcome to our world.<br/><br/>Welcome to Neighbourhood.</p>"
          }
        }
